  "description": "[Handsome Researcher Top ‘Roun’ x Beautiful Bottom with Erectile Dysfunction ‘Seonwoo’]\n\nRoun, the No. 1 player in the MMORPG “Cobalt” known as “Silver-Haired,” and Seonwoo, the No. 2 player known as “Moist Cain,” are famous rivals.\n\nSeonwoo, currently ranked second, comes across an event offering a trial of an erectile dysfunction treatment device that rewards participants with the ancient-grade weapon ‘Titan’ and decides to participate...\n\n*“This isn’t erectile dysfunction treatment—it’s tentacle play!”*\n\nWhat will become of the two as they meet as a researcher and a test subject...?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062214)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \n[Japanese](https://honto.jp/ebook/pd-series_C-MBJ-21782-4-607134X.html)",
